Triangle of coefficients of shifted Chebyshev's S(n,x-2) = U(n,x/2-1) polynomials (exponents of x in decreasing order).

The 67 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
